1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:15,000
残酷な天使のように 少年よ 神話になれ

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:37,000
青い風が今 胸のドアを叩いても 私だけをただ見つめて 微笑んでるあなた

3
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:52,000
そっと触れるもの 求めることに夢中で 運命さえまだ知らない 痛い気な瞳

4
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:59,000
だけどいつか気づくでしょう その背中には

5
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:07,000
遥か未来 目指すための羽があること

6
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,000
残酷な天使の帝世 窓辺からやがて到達

7
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:22,000
もっと走る熱いパッドスで 思い出を裏切るなら

8
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,000
この空を抱いて輝く 少年よ 神話になれ

9
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Shinji knows where they are. Katsuragi, the truth is with you. Don't hesitate. Move ahead. If I can see you again, I will say the words that I could not say eight years ago. Bye.

10
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Another phone that will never ring.

11
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Misato's shutting herself off again. As usual.

12
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Is Asuka going to come back today?

13
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:41,000
She skips school. She won't go home. All she does is play those games.

14
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
Kari? Uh, yes? Can I sleep here?

15
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Yeah.

16
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Yeah.

17
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,000
I'm sorry I'm inconveniencing you.

18
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,000
You're not inconvenient.

19
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Asuka.

20
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:22,000
When I didn't win with my Ava, I lost whatever value I might have had.

21
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,000
I hate.

22
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,000
I hate.

23
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
I hate everything.

24
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:31,000
And I hate myself the most.

25
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:35,000
I don't care about anything anymore.

26
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,000
There's no point.

27
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:44,000
There's nothing to be ashamed of, Asuka. You did the best you could. You should be proud.

28
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,000
So, that child is gone.

29
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Yes. Even cats die.

30
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Don't cry, Grandma.

31
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:09,000
Yes, I'll come home as soon as I have time.

32
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,000
I haven't visited mother's grave in three years.

33
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Yes, I'll call you next time.

34
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,000
Yeah, so even cats can die.

35
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:30,000
It is impossible to retrieve the land so long in us now.

36
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Why did you use it?

37
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,000
And about the Ava series, we don't have them all scheduled yet.

38
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:39,000
Destroying the Angels is our top priority. There was no other way.

39
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:45,000
No other way? You'd better come up with a more believable excuse.

40
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Your actions these days belie a lack of respect for this committee.

41
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Vyutski, I'm in conference.

42
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,000
Understood.

43
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Another Angel is approaching. We must finish this later.

44
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
You're assuming you'll still have a seat here.

45
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:07,000
Are you going to betray us, Sikari?

46
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:14,000
I'll be there in 15 minutes. Sort at Unit 0 through the 32nd gate. Use Unit 2 as the backup.

47
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:19,000
No, I'm sorry. I don't have the authority to cancel the commander's freeze on Unit 1.

48
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,000
That's right. Bye.

49
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,000
It's another Angel, all right. Damn.

50
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,000
Unit 0 has launched. Advancing to intercept.

51
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,000
Unit 2, remain in the launch bay.

52
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,000
No. Move it out.

53
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,000
What?

54
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:40,000
No arguments. It might be useful as a decoy at least.

55
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Right.

56
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,000
Ava Unit 2, ready to launch.

57
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:48,000
Here I am in this seat again. Am I even linked to this thing anymore?

58
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:53,000
Unit 2, advance to the 8th gate. Stand ready to move out as soon as your launch position is determined.

59
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:57,000
Even if I go, I'll just be a burden on the others.

60
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,000
Target approaching. It's past the final intercept line at Gora.

61
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,000
I just don't care anymore.

62
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:15,000
The target is above the Milwaukee Donny Valley, rotating in a fixed position.

63
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Target's AT field is still active.

64
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Where have you been?

65
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,000
I'm sorry. No excuse. Status report.

66
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,000
It looks like we're in a stalemate, Major.

67
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,000
He's right. The target's field pattern keeps cycling from blue to orange.

68
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,000
What does that mean?

69
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,000
The Magi aren't able to answer that question yet.

70
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,000
We just don't have enough solid data right now.

71
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:38,000
However, I'm certain that it's capable of assuming forms besides the one we see now.

72
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,000
So we can't attack first.

73
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,000
Rey, let's hold back and study it for a bit.

74
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,000
Oh, it's coming.

75
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Rey, efface of action!

76
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
She can't! There's not enough time!

77
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:02,000
Contamination! The target's affecting Unit Zero!

78
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,000
Watch the status on Unit Zero's AT field!

79
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:07,000
Her AT field's up, but it's not stopping the Angel's energy probe!

80
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:11,000
Is the Angel trying to establish first-level contact with Unit Zero?

81
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
It must be!

82
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:24,000
We've got biocontamination invading Unit Zero!

83
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,000
Ava Unit Two, roll out!

84
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,000
Take some of that heat off of Rey!

85
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,000
Target's invasion of Unit Zero continuing!

86
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:38,000
This isn't good. More than 5% has already undergone biofusion.

87
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:47,000
Asuka, advance 300 meters and spread your AT field to maximum!

88
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:50,000
Then fire your pallet gun into the target's vex section!

89
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
Ava Unit Two, lift off!

90
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,000
What are you doing?

91
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,000
Asuka, move out now!

92
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,000
What's wrong with her?

93
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,000
She can't sink!

94
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,000
Her sink ratio is under 10%!

95
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,000
Asuka!

96
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,000
It... it just won't move.

97
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,000
It won't move!

98
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:08,000
She's just the target sitting out there!

99
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,000
Get her back!

100
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,000
Do it now!

101
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Who is this?

102
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,000
You?

103
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,000
Myself?

104
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,000
And an Ava?

105
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,000
I sense somebody other than myself.

106
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Who are you?

107
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,000
An Angel.

108
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:34,000
Are you one of the beings we call the angels?

109
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,000
Don't you want to become one with me?

110
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,000
No.

111
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,000
I am me, not you.

112
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,000
But you shall.

113
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,000
It's too late.

114
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,000
I will share part of my mind with you.

115
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:53,000
Let me share with you these emotions.

116
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,000
This is pain.

117
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,000
Do you feel this pain?

118
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,000
This pain?

119
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,000
No.

120
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,000
It's different.

121
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,000
Loneliness.

122
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,000
Yes.

123
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Loneliness.

124
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,000
Loneliness?

125
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,000
I don't understand.

126
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:12,000
You don't want to be by yourself, correct?

127
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,000
We are many, but you are alone.

128
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,000
You hate it, don't you?

129
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:19,000
That is what it is to be lonely.

130
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,000
That is what your mind is.

131
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
It is what fills your soul.

132
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
You are that sorrow.

133
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,000
Is this a tear?

134
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,000
Am I the one crying?

135
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
Ray!

136
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:40,000
I want Evangelion Unit 1 taken out of cryostasis.

137
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,000
Launch it immediately.

138
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,000
What?

139
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
I said launch it!

140
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,000
Yes, sir.

141
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,000
Why for her?

142
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,000
Am I so worthless you couldn't do this for me?

143
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,000
Spread your AT field to full!

144
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,000
Get way out of there now!

145
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Right!

146
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,000
Ikari!

147
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,000
Ah!

148
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:17,000
Take my mind and soul to become one with Ikari.

149
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,000
You will not!

150
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,000
Her AT field's been reversed!

151
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,000
She's got viral contamination everywhere!

152
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,000
She's trying to contain the angel!

153
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Ray, abandon Unit 0!

154
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,000
Get out of there!

155
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,000
I cannot.

156
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:33,000
If I leave Unit 0, the AT field will cease to be.

157
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,000
I will not let it be.

158
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,000
Ray, don't do it!

159
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,000
Her core is collapsing.

160
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,000
It's past critical.

