The targets disappear.

186
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,000
This operation is over.

187
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,000
Downgrade.

188
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Alert status to condition Yellow!

189
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,000
Roger.

190
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:22,000
Shifting Alert status to condition Yellow.

191
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,000
What's the status of Unit 0?

192
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:28,000
I don't think the entry plug ejected.

193
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:31,000
Send out a rescue team, if there's anything left to rescue.

194
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:50,340
Dr. Akagi, we've located the plug!

195
00:11:53,660 --> 00:11:54,860
Dr. Akagi.

196
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:58,660
Classify everything here as top secret.

197
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:01,300
Clean out the plug and destroy everything.

198
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:04,000
Understood. Do it now!

199
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:10,000
At last, we have defeated all of the angels up to the 16th.

200
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,700
Now there's only one left.

201
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:15,420
As it is written in Zele's Dead Sea Scrolls.

202
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,140
The promised time is at hand.

203
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:20,980
The road has been long and the sacrifices have been great.

204
00:12:21,260 --> 00:12:24,140
True. We have lost the lance of Lajonus.

205
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:26,220
And now unit zero.

206
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,700
That is sufficient reason for removing Akari.

207
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:32,080
Surely he must have understood what the release of the Utsuki meant.

208
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:36,240
We shall have to find another cat's paw to use against Akari.

209
00:12:36,640 --> 00:12:38,860
And this one must know the truth.

210
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:42,660
The Roswell explicities are left with Matt and 출.

211
00:12:54,660 --> 00:12:57,700
But then a junior at firstkline, we may have to be determined to have loan paid for each other.

212
