lights, smith, dia can come in.

214
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:06,380
We did not look for it in ourhangs.

215
00:13:06,380 --> 00:13:14,980
Misato, I can't cry anymore.

216
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:18,260
I feel the pain, but the tears won't come.

217
00:13:18,780 --> 00:13:19,460
Why is that?

218
00:13:20,820 --> 00:13:24,480
Shinji, I don't know what to do or say.

219
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,200
All I can do is be here for you.

220
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:28,080
Don't touch me!

221
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:31,060
Just leave me alone, Misato.

222
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:32,780
I'm sorry.

223
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:39,420
I know how lonely he must be.

224
00:13:40,300 --> 00:13:41,940
Does the fact that I'm a woman frighten him?

225
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:44,440
Or is he afraid of getting close to anyone?

226
00:13:46,420 --> 00:13:48,200
Pen-pen, come here.

227
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:52,760
It's true.

228
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:54,940
Anything is better than being alone.

229
00:13:55,500 --> 00:13:56,900
And I'm the one who's lonely.

230
00:14:06,380 --> 00:14:08,500
Hello?

231
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:10,500
Yes?

232
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:11,000
What?

233
00:14:11,640 --> 00:14:12,060
Shinji!

234
00:14:12,940 --> 00:14:15,940
Dr. Odani, 1st Internal Division, Dr. Odani.

235
00:14:16,100 --> 00:14:18,080
Please call Conference Room 2 immediately.

236
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:19,500
Ray!

237
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:25,740
I'm so glad.

238
00:14:26,560 --> 00:14:28,080
I can't believe you're alive.

239
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:30,600
Why isn't my father here?

240
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:35,040
Anyway, thank you for saving my life.

241
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:36,360
For doing what?

242
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,620
You saved me.

243
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:40,880
By sacrificing Unit Zero.

244
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:43,620
Oh, did I save you?

245
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,520
Don't you remember?

246
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:48,480
I just don't know.

247
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:51,840
I think, I think I must be the third one.

248
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:28,840
I'm seeing this for the first time, and yet, this feels like this is not the first time.

249
00:15:29,980 --> 00:15:31,600
Why am I crying?

250
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:34,080
What am I crying for?

251
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:36,400
Yes, that's right.

252
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:41,080
Put a hold on Ray's, on the first child's current status.

253
00:15:41,740 --> 00:15:43,160
Just keep your eyes on.

254
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:44,080
Nothing more.

255
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:49,920
The fact that Ray is even alive is likely to cause a great deal of trouble with Chairman Keele.

256
00:15:50,140 --> 00:15:53,380
I've given the old men of Zele something else to look at.

257
00:15:53,740 --> 00:15:54,640
There is no problem.

258
00:15:56,420 --> 00:16:00,280
It is our intent to carry out this inquisition in a dignified manner.

259
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:03,840
It is not our intent to bring any shame upon you.

260
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:06,260
I don't feel any shame.

261
00:16:06,620 --> 00:16:07,720
She is a strong woman.

262
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:10,520
I can see why Ikari wants to keep her next to him.

263
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:16,440
However, were you aware the one who sent you here was none other than Ikari himself?

264
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:24,180
He refused our request for the pilot of Unit Zero, and has sent you here in her stead, Dr. Akagi.

265
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:26,300
He sent me instead of her?

266
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:34,320
The way to the truth, which you wanted, was sent by 36 other methods, but they won't reach you.

267
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:37,620
The only way that is guaranteed is this capsule.

268
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,040
This is all I have.

269
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:43,400
Now it's completely up to you as to how to use this.

270
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:46,340
The passcode is our first memory.

271
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:47,960
Goodbye.

272
00:16:48,780 --> 00:16:49,520
And take care.

273
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:54,820
The silence from you no longer hurts as much as it once did.

274
00:16:57,400 --> 00:17:00,180
Not since you gave me your heart and soul.

275
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:06,700
So, has Dr. Akagi's deposition proved acceptable?

276
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,180
She is not like Piuski.

277
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:10,540
It is more beneficial for us to release her.

278
00:17:10,940 --> 00:17:14,360
The woman has rendered remarkable service to the Eva series.

279
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:17,000
Let it continue to be of use for a while.

280
00:17:17,220 --> 00:17:18,540
For the future of mankind.

281
00:17:18,540 --> 00:17:22,380
As for the Evangelions themselves, there are now eight under construction.

282
00:17:22,660 --> 00:17:24,500
And four that are not.

283
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:28,260
The disappearance of Tokyo 3 will prove to be a boon to the project.

284
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,260
We must accelerate to completion.

285
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:33,640
On that day, the promised time will be at hand.

286
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:38,540
Hello?

287
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:40,100
Listen to me carefully.

288
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:43,720
For the next few minutes, you'll be free from the secret service.

289
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:45,880
Come here now while you can.

290
00:17:46,020 --> 00:17:46,420
Rizko?

291
00:17:46,420 --> 00:18:01,220
Sorry, it won't work without my password.

292
00:18:01,900 --> 00:18:02,600
I see.

293
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,620
Did Kaji arrange this?

294
00:18:04,760 --> 00:18:05,600
Show them to me.

295
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,360
All the secrets you buried here.

296
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:08,240
All right.

297
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:10,120
But this one will see them as well.

298
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:13,880
Agreed.

299
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:34,240
This looks just like Rey's room.

300
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:35,900
That's not surprising.

301
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:38,320
This is the place where Rey was born.

302
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:39,380
She was what?

303
00:18:39,380 --> 00:18:41,000
She was born here.

304
00:18:41,500 --> 00:18:46,720
The visions of light and water that stream through her consciousness are merely reflections of this place.

305
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:50,280
Dr. Akagi, this isn't what I came to see.

306
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:53,280
I know that, Misato.

307
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:58,740
Is that Aunt Ava?

308
00:18:59,000 --> 00:18:59,760
The first one.

309
00:19:00,180 --> 00:19:00,640
A failure.

310
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:03,080
We abandoned it ten years ago.

311
00:19:03,700 --> 00:19:05,420
A graveyard for Avas.

312
00:19:05,900 --> 00:19:07,000
Nothing that elaborate.

313
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:08,460
Just a dumping ground.

314
00:19:09,420 --> 00:19:11,660
It's also the place where your mother was taken from you.

315
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:15,960
You may not remember it, but you were watching at the very moment when your mother disappeared.

316
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:18,800
Do you remember that, Shinji?

317
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:30,500
Dr. Akagi, this is the core of a dummy plug?

318
00:19:30,620 --> 00:19:32,840
This is where we produce the components.

319
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:40,060
Oh my God!

320
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,040
It's Rey!

321
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:43,540
They're all Rey!

322
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:45,380
You mean the dummy plugs are...

323
00:19:45,380 --> 00:19:45,800
Uh-huh.

324
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:48,040
These are the cores of the dummy plugs.

325
00:19:48,320 --> 00:19:49,900
They're what makes the system work.

326
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:50,820
Who are they?

327
00:19:51,280 --> 00:19:51,800
These?

328
00:19:52,260 --> 00:19:53,640
These are empty vessels.

329
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:55,520
Nothing but spare parts.

330
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:57,140
Spare rays.

331
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:02,200
Mankind found a God and man.

332
00:20:02,700 --> 00:20:05,760
In his folly, tried to make the God his toy.

333
00:20:05,760 --> 00:20:09,160
For that arrogance, mankind was punished.

334
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:12,180
That happened fifteen years ago.

335
00:20:12,820 --> 00:20:15,680
And the God that man found was lost.

336
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:19,560
But man continues to attempt to resurrect the God.

337
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:25,920
And from that God, Adam, man attempted to make a man who was like a God himself.

338
00:20:26,580 --> 00:20:28,220
And that was Ava.

339
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:28,880
What?

340
00:20:29,940 --> 00:20:30,880
Avas are human?

341
00:20:31,500 --> 00:20:31,940
Yes.

342
00:20:32,780 --> 00:20:35,700
Inside the empty shell of each Ava is a human soul.

343
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:39,320
But the only vessel which can hold a soul is Rey.

344
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:42,280
These things are empty husks.

345
00:20:42,800 --> 00:20:43,860
They have no souls.

346
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:45,580
No right to live.

347
00:20:46,660 --> 00:20:49,260
The room of God is empty.

348
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:54,320
Stop this!

349
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:56,160
Do you have any idea what you're doing?

350
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:58,300
Yes, I know.

351
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:00,960
I'm destroying them.

352
00:21:01,860 --> 00:21:02,880
These aren't human.

353
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:04,680
Just things with human forms.

354
00:21:05,380 --> 00:21:06,280
But even so,

355
00:21:06,940 --> 00:21:09,100
I lost to these things.

356
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:11,240
To these soulless dolls.

357
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:13,040
I couldn't win.

358
00:21:13,940 --> 00:21:16,020
I could have suffered any humiliation.

359
00:21:17,120 --> 00:21:18,080
Endured any torture.

360
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:21,240
But he had already chosen.

361
00:21:22,660 --> 00:21:24,500
God, I'm a fool.

362
00:21:25,140 --> 00:21:26,500
Like mother, like daughter.

363
00:21:27,260 --> 00:21:28,340
Fools to the end.

364
00:21:29,100 --> 00:21:31,120
If you want to kill me, go ahead and do it.

365
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:32,720
I'd welcome death.

366
